       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TWOMAINT.
       AUTHOR.         CA YODER.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   NOVEMBER 1995.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *****************************************************************
      *
      *     VERBAL WORKORDER FILE MAINTENANCE
      *
      *****************************************************************
      *     THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO ADD, MODIFY, AND DELETE
      *     RECORDS IN THE "VERBWOFL" FILE WHICH IS USED TO
      *     AUTOMATICALLY GENERATE VERBAL WORKORDERS.
      *****************************************************************
      **                   MODIFICATION   HISTORY
      *****************************************************************
      *    12/1/00     JE COFFMAN
      *     ADDED A FREQUENCY INDICATOR TO THE SCREEN AT NAPANEE'S
      *     REQUEST SO THAT THEY COULD GENERATE WORK ORDERS ON A
      *     WEEKLY OR MONTHLY BASIS AS WELL AS A DAILY BASIS.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    JAN 19 2005  D. RAUCH     DCR01      REQUEST# 2004-25457
      *       1)  ADDED FREQUENCY VALUE OF "Q" FOR QUARTERLY
      *****************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZWOMAINT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT EQP-EQUIPMENT
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT WO-CRAFTS-REQD
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT VERBWOFL-SEQ
                  ASSIGN       TO DISK-VERBWOFL
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                  ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT VERBWOFL-FLAT-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO DISK-VERBWOFL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC             PIC X(2000).

       FD  EQP-EQUIPMENT
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  EQP-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0201.

       FD  WO-CRAFTS-REQD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  CFT-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0601.

       FD  VERBWOFL-SEQ
           DATA RECORD IS VERBWOFL-SEQ-REC
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  VERBWOFL-SEQ-REC        PIC X(200).

       FD  VERBWOFL-FLAT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS VERBWOFL-FF-REC
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  VERBWOFL-FF-REC            PIC X(200).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1        PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2        PIC X VALUE SPACE.

       01  SUB                           PIC 99     VALUE 0.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10)  VALUE "  STORES;".

       01  PROG-SWITCHES.
           05  ERROR-FOUND               PIC X(1)   VALUE "N".
           05  VERBWOFL-EOF-SW           PIC X(1)   VALUE "N".

DCR01  01  WS-PGM-MSSG.
DCR01      03  WS-FREQ-MSG               PIC X(80)   VALUE
DCR01           "FIELD MUST CONTAIN 'D' OR 'W' OR 'M' OR 'Q'".

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                  PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                   PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  EQUIPMENT-DATA.
           COPY MEQPFILE       IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-CRAFT-DATA.
           COPY MWOCRAFT       IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VERBWOFL           IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                     I N P U T   S C R E E N                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       01  OPT-SCREEN.
           05  OPT-OPTION                PIC X.
           05  OPT-INFO-LINE             PIC X(74).
           05  OPT-MSGLINE               PIC X(80).

       01  WO-SCREEN.
           05  SC-FUNCTION               PIC X(23).
           05  SC-FIELDS.
               10  SC-EQUIP-NUM          PIC X(6).
               10  SC-REQUESTOR          PIC X(16).
               10  SC-SKILL-REQ    OCCURS 3 TIMES
                                         PIC X(2).
               10  SC-WO-DESCRIP         PIC X(30).
               10  SC-ADDL-INFO.
                   15  SC-ADDL-INFO-1    PIC X(66).
                   15  SC-ADDL-INFO-2    PIC X(66).
           05  SC-FREQ-IND               PIC X.
           05  SC-INFO-LINE              PIC X(74).
           05  SC-MSGLINE                PIC X(80).

       COPY TBLOWUP      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA     IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMAREA     IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE     IN COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *           P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N            *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0-BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "TWOMAINT" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O            DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT          EQP-EQUIPMENT
                               WO-CRAFTS-REQD.


       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE               DISPLAY-FILE
                               EQP-EQUIPMENT
                               WO-CRAFTS-REQD.
           GOBACK.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *               B L O W U P   R O U T I N E                 *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *                 M A I N   P A R A G R A P H               *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "OPTION"       TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACE          TO OPT-OPTION.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "TYPE IN THE APPROPRIATE OPTION AND PRESS THE ENTER KEY"
                               TO OPT-INFO-LINE.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE OPT-SCREEN     TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO OPT-SCREEN.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

       6-CONT.
           IF OPT-OPTION = "A"
               OPEN EXTEND     VERBWOFL-FLAT-FILE
               PERFORM 60-ADD-RECORD THRU 60-EXIT
               CLOSE           VERBWOFL-FLAT-FILE
           ELSE
           IF OPT-OPTION = "C"
               OPEN I-O        VERBWOFL-SEQ
               PERFORM 61-CHANGE-RECORD THRU 61-EXIT
               CLOSE           VERBWOFL-SEQ
           ELSE
           IF OPT-OPTION = "D"
               OPEN I-O        VERBWOFL-SEQ
               PERFORM 62-DELETE-RECORD THRU 62-EXIT
               CLOSE           VERBWOFL-SEQ.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *               A D D   A   R E C O R D                     *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       60-ADD-RECORD.
           MOVE "MAIN"         TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-SCREEN.
           MOVE " ADD VERBAL WORKORDER  "  TO SC-FUNCTION.
           MOVE "D"            TO SC-FREQ-IND.
      *------ UN-PROTECT FIELDS.
           MOVE B"0"           TO IND(40).

       60-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "ENTER THE DATA ABOVE AND PRESS <ENTER> TO ADD W/O"
      -                        TO SC-INFO-LINE.

       60-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE WO-SCREEN      TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO WO-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 60-EXIT.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

       60-CHECK-FIELDS.
           IF SC-EQUIP-NUM = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(21)
                                  IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER EQUIPMENT NUMBER"  TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           IF SC-REQUESTOR = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(22)
                                  IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER REQUESTOR"         TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           IF SC-SKILL-REQ (1) = SPACES AND SC-SKILL-REQ (2) = SPACES
                                        AND SC-SKILL-REQ (3) = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(23)
                                  IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER AT LEAST ONE SKILL" TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           IF SC-WO-DESCRIP = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(26)
                                  IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER DESCRIPTION"       TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.

      *------ MAKE SURE IT'S A VALID EQUIPMENT NUMBER.
           MOVE "N"            TO ERROR-FOUND.
           PERFORM 630-VALIDATE-EQUIP.
           IF ERROR-FOUND = "Y"
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)  IND(21)
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.

           MOVE "N"            TO ERROR-FOUND.

      *------ MAKE SURE THEY ARE VALID SKILLS.
           PERFORM 630-VALIDATE-SKILL VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                          UNTIL SUB > 3 OR ERROR-FOUND = "Y".

           IF ERROR-FOUND = "Y"
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)
               IF SUB = 2
                   MOVE B"1"   TO IND(23)
               END-IF
               IF SUB = 3
                   MOVE B"1"   TO IND(24)
               END-IF
               IF SUB = 4
                   MOVE B"1"   TO IND(25)
               END-IF
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.

      **** IF SC-FREQ-IND = "D" OR "W" OR "M" OR "Q"
DCR01      IF  SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "D"
DCR01      AND SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "W"
DCR01      AND SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "M"
DCR01      AND SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "Q"
DCR01          MOVE WS-FREQ-MSG TO SC-MSGLINE
DCR01          MOVE B"1"           TO IND(29)  IND(99)
DCR01          GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
DCR01      END-IF.

       60-WRITE-RECORD.
           MOVE SC-EQUIP-NUM       TO  V-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE SC-REQUESTOR       TO  V-REQUESTOR.
           MOVE "1"                TO  V-PRIORITY.
           MOVE SC-WO-DESCRIP      TO  V-WO-DESCRIP.
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (1)   TO  V-SKILL-REQ (1).
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (2)   TO  V-SKILL-REQ (2).
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (3)   TO  V-SKILL-REQ (3).
           MOVE SC-ADDL-INFO       TO  V-ADDL-INFO.
           MOVE SC-FREQ-IND        TO  V-FREQ-IND.
           PERFORM 630-SHIFT-SKILLS
           WRITE VERBWOFL-FF-REC FROM BUF-VERBWOFL.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "PROBLEM WITH ADDING WORKORDER--CONTACT PROGRAMMING
      -             "STAFF"        TO  OPT-MSGLINE
           ELSE
               MOVE "** WORKORDER ADDED **"  TO  OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE SPACES         TO  SC-FIELDS.

           MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99).
           GO TO 60-EXIT.

       60-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *              C H A N G E   A   R E C O R D                *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       61-CHANGE-RECORD.
           MOVE "MAIN"         TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-SCREEN.
           MOVE "CHANGE VERBAL WORKORDER"  TO SC-FUNCTION.
      *------ SEE IF ANY RECORDS EXIST IN THE FILE.
           MOVE "N"             TO VERBWOFL-EOF-SW.
           PERFORM 61-READ-FILE.
           IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "NO WORKORDERS TO DISPLAY OR CHANGE"
                                TO  OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"        TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 61-EXIT.

       61-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT WORKORDER OR MAKE CHANGES AND
      -        "PRESS F7"  TO  SC-INFO-LINE.

       61-SHOW-FORM.
      *------ SHOW FUNCTION KEYS.
           MOVE B"1"           TO IND(30)   IND(33).
      *------ UN-PROTECT FIELDS.
           MOVE B"0"           TO IND(40).

           MOVE WO-SCREEN      TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO WO-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 61-EXIT.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

      *------ CANNOT PRESS ENTER KEY.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 0
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-CONTINUE.
      *------ DISPLAY NEXT RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 4
               IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW NOT = "Y"
                   PERFORM 61-READ-FILE
                   MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT WORKORDER OR MAKE CHAN
      -                     "GES AND PRESS F7"  TO  SC-INFO-LINE
               END-IF
      *---------- IF END OF FILE, RESTART LIST
               IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "Y"
                   CLOSE             VERBWOFL-SEQ
                   OPEN I-O          VERBWOFL-SEQ
                   MOVE "N"         TO  VERBWOFL-EOF-SW
                   PERFORM 61-READ-FILE
                   IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "Y"
                       MOVE "NO RECORDS TO DISPLAY OR CHANGE--PRESS F3 T
      -                     "O EXIT"    TO  SC-INFO-LINE
                   END-IF
                   GO TO 61-PUT-BUFFER
               END-IF
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.

      *------ CHANGE RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
               PERFORM 61-CHECK-FIELDS
               PERFORM 61-MOVE-SCREEN-FIELDS
               PERFORM 630-SHIFT-SKILLS
               REWRITE VERBWOFL-SEQ-REC FROM BUF-VERBWOFL
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "++ PROBLEM WITH WRITE--CONTACT PROGRAMMER ++"
                                TO OPT-MSGLINE
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES  TO SC-FIELDS
                                   BUF-VERBWOFL
                   MOVE "** WORKORDER CHANGED **" TO OPT-MSGLINE
               END-IF
               MOVE B"1"    TO IND(99)
               GO TO 61-EXIT
           END-IF.

       61-READ-FILE.
           READ VERBWOFL-SEQ INTO BUF-VERBWOFL
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO VERBWOFL-EOF-SW.

           IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "N"
               PERFORM 61-MOVE-WO-FIELDS.

           IF V-FREQ-IND = " " MOVE "D" TO V-FREQ-IND.

       61-MOVE-WO-FIELDS.
           MOVE V-EQUIP-NUM        TO  SC-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE V-REQUESTOR        TO  SC-REQUESTOR.
           MOVE V-WO-DESCRIP       TO  SC-WO-DESCRIP.
           MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (1)    TO  SC-SKILL-REQ (1).
           MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (2)    TO  SC-SKILL-REQ (2).
           MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)    TO  SC-SKILL-REQ (3).
           MOVE V-ADDL-INFO        TO  SC-ADDL-INFO.
           MOVE V-FREQ-IND         TO  SC-FREQ-IND.

       61-MOVE-SCREEN-FIELDS.
           MOVE SC-EQUIP-NUM       TO  V-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE SC-REQUESTOR       TO  V-REQUESTOR.
           MOVE SC-WO-DESCRIP      TO  V-WO-DESCRIP.
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (1)   TO  V-SKILL-REQ (1).
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (2)   TO  V-SKILL-REQ (2).
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (3)   TO  V-SKILL-REQ (3).
           MOVE SC-ADDL-INFO       TO  V-ADDL-INFO.
           MOVE SC-FREQ-IND        TO  V-FREQ-IND.

       61-CHECK-FIELDS.
           IF SC-EQUIP-NUM = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(21)  IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER EQUIPMENT NUMBER"  TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.


           IF SC-REQUESTOR = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(22)  IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER REQUESTOR"         TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.


           IF SC-SKILL-REQ (1) = SPACES AND SC-SKILL-REQ (2) = SPACES
                                        AND SC-SKILL-REQ (3) = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(23)   IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER AT LEAST ONE SKILL" TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.


           IF SC-WO-DESCRIP = SPACES
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(26)   IND(99)
               MOVE "MUST ENTER DESCRIPTION"       TO  SC-MSGLINE
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.


      *------ MAKE SURE IT'S A VALID EQUIPMENT NUMBER.
           MOVE "N"            TO ERROR-FOUND.
           PERFORM 630-VALIDATE-EQUIP.
           IF ERROR-FOUND = "Y"
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(21)  IND(99)
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.

           MOVE "N"            TO ERROR-FOUND.

      *------ MAKE SURE THEY ARE VALID SKILLS.
           PERFORM 630-VALIDATE-SKILL VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                          UNTIL SUB > 3 OR ERROR-FOUND = "Y".

           IF ERROR-FOUND = "Y"
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)
               IF SUB = 2
                   MOVE B"1"   TO IND(23)
               END-IF
               IF SUB = 3
                   MOVE B"1"   TO IND(24)
               END-IF
               IF SUB = 4
                   MOVE B"1"   TO IND(25)
               END-IF
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.


      **** IF SC-FREQ-IND = "D" OR "W" OR "M" OR "Q"
DCR01      IF  SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "D"
DCR01      AND SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "W"
DCR01      AND SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "M"
DCR01      AND SC-FREQ-IND NOT = "Q"
DCR01          MOVE WS-FREQ-MSG TO SC-MSGLINE
DCR01          MOVE B"1"           TO IND(29)  IND(99)
DCR01          GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM
DCR01      END-IF.

       61-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *              D E L E T E   A   R E C O R D                *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       62-DELETE-RECORD.
           MOVE "MAIN"         TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-SCREEN.
           MOVE "DELETE VERBAL WORKORDER"  TO SC-FUNCTION.
      *------ SEE IF ANY RECORDS EXIST IN THE FILE.
           MOVE "N"             TO VERBWOFL-EOF-SW.
           PERFORM 62-READ-FILE.
           IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "NO WORKORDERS TO DISPLAY OR DELETE"
                                TO  OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"        TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 62-EXIT.

       62-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT WORKORDER OR PRESS F6 TO DELET
      -         "E"             TO SC-INFO-LINE.

       62-SHOW-FORM.
      *------ PROTECT ALL FIELDS & SHOW FUNCTION KEYS.
           MOVE B"1"            TO IND(30)   IND(32)   IND(40).
      *------ GET RID OF UNDERLINE ON FIELDS.
           MOVE B"1"            TO IND(41).

           MOVE WO-SCREEN       TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC     TO WO-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 62-EXIT.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

      *------ CANNOT PRESS ENTER KEY.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 0
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-CONTINUE.
      *------ DISPLAY NEXT RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 4
               IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW NOT = "Y"
                   PERFORM 62-READ-FILE
                   MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT WORKORDER OR PRESS F6
      -                     "TO DELETE"  TO  SC-INFO-LINE
               END-IF
      *------ IF END OF FILE, OFFER OPTION TO RESTART LIST.
               IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "Y"
                   CLOSE             VERBWOFL-SEQ
                   OPEN I-O          VERBWOFL-SEQ
                   MOVE "N"         TO  VERBWOFL-EOF-SW
                   PERFORM 62-READ-FILE
                   IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "Y"
                       MOVE "NO RECORDS TO DISPLAY OR DELETE--PRESS F3 T
      -                     "O EXIT"    TO  SC-INFO-LINE
                   END-IF
                   GO TO 62-PUT-BUFFER
               END-IF
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM
           END-IF.

      *------ DELETE RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 6
               DELETE VERBWOFL-SEQ
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-DELETE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "++ PROBLEM WITH DELETE--CONTACT PROGRAMMER ++"
                                TO OPT-MSGLINE
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES  TO SC-FIELDS
                                   BUF-VERBWOFL
                   MOVE "** WORKORDER DELETED **" TO OPT-MSGLINE
               END-IF
               MOVE B"1"    TO IND(99)
               GO TO 62-EXIT
           END-IF.

       62-READ-FILE.
           READ VERBWOFL-SEQ INTO BUF-VERBWOFL
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO VERBWOFL-EOF-SW.
           IF VERBWOFL-EOF-SW = "N"
               PERFORM 62-MOVE-FIELDS.

       62-MOVE-FIELDS.
           MOVE V-EQUIP-NUM        TO  SC-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE V-REQUESTOR        TO  SC-REQUESTOR.
           MOVE V-WO-DESCRIP       TO  SC-WO-DESCRIP.
           MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (1)    TO  SC-SKILL-REQ (1).
           MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (2)    TO  SC-SKILL-REQ (2).
           MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)    TO  SC-SKILL-REQ (3).
           MOVE V-ADDL-INFO        TO  SC-ADDL-INFO.
           MOVE V-FREQ-IND         TO  SC-FREQ-IND.

       62-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       630-VALIDATE-EQUIP.
           MOVE SC-EQUIP-NUM       TO  EQPNUM OF EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           READ EQP-EQUIPMENT  INTO EQUIPMENT-DATA
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "EQUIPMENT NUMBER DOES NOT EXIST"
                                  TO  SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE "Y"           TO  ERROR-FOUND
           ELSE
           IF EQP-SAFETY-FLG = "X"
               MOVE "CANNOT CREATE WORKORDER AGAINST SAFETY EQUIPMENT"
                                  TO  SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE "Y"           TO  ERROR-FOUND
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"           TO  ERROR-FOUND.

       630-VALIDATE-SKILL.
           MOVE SC-SKILL-REQ (SUB) TO  CRAFTREQD OF WO-CRAFTS-REQD.
           READ WO-CRAFTS-REQD INTO WO-CRAFT-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "INVALID SKILL ENTERED"  TO  SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE "Y"           TO  ERROR-FOUND
           END-IF.

       630-SHIFT-SKILLS.
           IF V-SKILL-REQ (1) = SPACES
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (2)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (1)
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).

           IF V-SKILL-REQ (1) = SPACES
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (2)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (1)
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).

           IF V-SKILL-REQ (2) = SPACES
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).

           IF V-SKILL-REQ (1) = V-SKILL-REQ (3)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).

           IF V-SKILL-REQ (1) = V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).

           IF V-SKILL-REQ (1) = V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE V-SKILL-REQ (3)  TO V-SKILL-REQ (2)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).

           IF V-SKILL-REQ (2) = V-SKILL-REQ (3)
               MOVE SPACES           TO V-SKILL-REQ (3).


       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
